{"features":[{"feature_idx":0,"name":"en","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":1,"name":"wo","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":2,"name":"non_standardized","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}}],"rows":[{"row_idx":1700,"row":{"en":"The firm's owner, Mr. Ishq Kasawa, says that the building was properly ventilated and that the employees were not exposed to any harmful chemicals.","wo":"Boroom entreprise bi, M. Ishq Kasawa, neena batimaa bi féex na bu baax ba noppi ni liggéeykat yaa ngi ci jàmm, amul lenn luy mëna lor seen wérgi-yaram.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBorom entreprise bi M. Ishq Kasawa néna batima bi fékh na bou bakh ba nopi ni ligueykat ya ngui thi diam amoul léne louy meuna lor séne wergui yaram\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1701,"row":{"en":"If you’re not a fan of store-bought cinnamon rolls that’s okay.","wo":"Sudee bëggoo mburu yu ndaw yu am kanel, loolu du dara.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSudé beugoo mbourou you ndaw you ame kanel lolou dou dara.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1702,"row":{"en":"Max plays guitar, bass, and drums, sings vocals, and writes the songs.","wo":"Max dafay jouer gitaar, bass, batëri, way te ci di bind way yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMax dafay jouer guitaar, bass, bateri, way té ci di bind way yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1703,"row":{"en":"* 1 large egg","wo":"* 1 nen bu rëy","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\n1 nen bou reuy\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1704,"row":{"en":"I was worried that I might have contracted Lyme disease, but I went to the doctor and he said that I didn't have anything to worry about.","wo":"Dama ragaloon ni dama am feebaru Lyme, waaye bama demee doktoor bi seet ma, nima jarul may jaaxle ndax dara dalu ma.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDama ragalone ni dama ame feebaru lyme wayé bama démé docteur bi set ma nima diaroul may diakhle ndakh dara dalouma.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1705,"row":{"en":"hire","wo":"jékki saa rekk am","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\ndieuki saa rek am\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1706,"row":{"en":"The Graduate Council's minimum requirements for advanced degrees are described below.","wo":"Matuwaay yi gëna ndaw yi ñuy laaj ci Graduate Council ngir am lijaasa daara ju kawe leeral nañu ko ci suuf.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMatouway yi geuna ndaw yi gnuy ladj thi Graduate Council nguir ame lidjassa daara djou kawe leeral nagnou ko thi souf.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1707,"row":{"en":"Psychiatric hospitals provide care for people with mental illness.","wo":"Hopitaal psychiatrik yi ñooy faj ñi am feebaru xel.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nHopital psychiatrik yi gnoy fadji gni ame febarou hel.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1708,"row":{"en":"I creep down the hallway, careful not to make a sound.","wo":"Ma yoot ndànk ba ci waañ wi ngir ñu bañ ma dégg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa yote ndank ba thi wagne wi nguir gnou bagne ma degg.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1709,"row":{"en":"If your next construction or mining project needs to transport bulk materials, you will most likely need a dump truck.","wo":"Soo tabax dara wala nga soxla gas ay mine, nga wara yab bagaas yu bari, kon dinga soxla lu melni kamioŋ mbalit.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo tabakh dara wala nga sokhla gasse ay mine, nga wara yabb bagasse you bari, kon dinga sokhla lou melni camion mbalite.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1710,"row":{"en":"It's not just about what you wear, but how you wear it.","wo":"Mbir mi du ci linga sol, waaye ci ninga ko solee la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMbir mi dou thi linga sol wayé thi ningako solé la\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1711,"row":{"en":"If you’ve been in Texas for any period, you probably cringe at the word.","wo":"Sudee mus nga dem Texas benn yoon, baat mi mën nala tiital.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSudé meuss nga dem texas ben yone bat bi meun nala tiital\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1712,"row":{"en":"how are you doing today","wo":"naka nga def tey","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNaka nga def tayé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1713,"row":{"en":"But then I heard a voice.","wo":"Ci noonu, ma dégg benn baat.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi nonou ma degue ben bat.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1714,"row":{"en":"Mother: Yes, it is. The stars are so far away, but with a telescope, we can see them up close.","wo":"Yaay ji: Waaw, rafetna kay. Biddéew yi dañoo sori, waaye soo leen di xool ci telescope dañu jege bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYaye dji: waw rafetna kay biddéw yi danio sori wayé so len di khol ci telescope daniou diegué bou bakh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1715,"row":{"en":"When we got to the park, we found a nice spot to spread out our blanket and eat our lunch.","wo":"Bi nu yeggee ci park bi, nu wut barab bu baax, lu lal sunuy mbàjj lekk sunu añ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi gnou yégé ci park bi, gnou wout barab bou bakh, lou lale souniou mbadi leke souniou agne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1716,"row":{"en":"I'll try those things.","wo":"Dinaa def linga ma wax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDina def linga ma wakh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1717,"row":{"en":"He picked up the snake and carried it to the police station.","wo":"Mu daal di jàpp jaan ji yóbbu ko komisaria police bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou daldi diap diane dji yobouko commissariat police bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1718,"row":{"en":"The narrative essay written by my peer was about a tool used to hold a sheet on a bed.","wo":"Bataaxelu nettali bi sama nattango bindon defa doon wax ci ab jumtukaay buñuy jëfandikoo ngir teye darab ci kaw lall.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBatakhalou netali bi sama natango bindone dafa done wakh thi ab jumtoukay bougnouy dieufandiko nguir teuye darab thi kaw lall.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1719,"row":{"en":"Acute inflammation is a normal part of the healing process.","wo":"Inflamation bu metti dafa bokk ci liy wéral.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nInflamation bou metti dafa bok thi liy wéral.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1720,"row":{"en":"He showed an early aptitude for mathematics and physics.","wo":"Dafa teela wane xarañteem ci physique ak ci math.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa téla wané kharagnteum thi physique ak thi math rk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1721,"row":{"en":"Another important thing I learned in high school was how to work effectively with others.","wo":"Meneen mbir mu am solo mima jàngee liise mooy ni ñuy liggéeyandoo bu baax ak ñeneen.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeneune mbir mou ame solo mima diangué lycée moy ni gnuy ligueyando bou bakh ak gnénéne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1722,"row":{"en":"Customer: That would be great. I'm willing to pay a little extra for that.","wo":"Kiliyaan bi: Loolu dinama neex. Loolu jaral nama ma dolli tuuti xaalis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nClient bi lolou dinama nekh lolou diaral nama ma dolli touti khaliss\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1723,"row":{"en":"send me your picture","wo":"yónnee ma sa foto","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYoneu ma sa photo rek\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1724,"row":{"en":"For example, some naming ceremonies now include electronic devices such as computers and projectors.","wo":"Ci misaal, yenn génte yi dañuy amaale yenn jumtukaayi xarala lu ci melni ordinatër wala ay projectër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi misal, yenn guenté yi daniouy amalé yenn jumtoukayi kharala lou thi melni ordinateur wala ay projecteur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1725,"row":{"en":"However, in Islam, surrender is actually seen as a positive act, a way to achieve peace and happiness.","wo":"Waaye ci Islam, dafay rafetlu baax baatu topp sa boroom, muy yoon wuy jëme ci jàmm ak bàneex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé thi islam dafay rafetlou bakh batou top sa borom mouy yoon wuy dieume si diam ak baneikh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1726,"row":{"en":"All female subjects will be required to take a urine pregnancy test before each Gardasil 9 dose.","wo":"Képp kuy jigéen di nga def test ngir xam ndax ëmboo laata ngay jël dosu Gardasil 9.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKeup kouy djiguéne dinga def test nguir kham ndakh embo laata ngay dieul dosou Gardasil 9.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1727,"row":{"en":"With over 200 million followers on Instagram, Kardashian is a powerful force in the fashion, beauty, and lifestyle industries.","wo":"Kardashiam amna lu ëpp 200 milioŋ nit ñu koy topp ci Instagram, muy luy am solo ci wàllu modd, taar, ay ñiy liggéey ci dundin.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKardashiam amna lou eup 200 million nit gnou koy top thi instagram, mouy louy am solo si wallou mode, taar, ay gniy liguey si doundine.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1728,"row":{"en":"I have a lot of freedom, and I can do whatever I want.","wo":"Maa moom sama bopp, te mën naa def luma neex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMaa mom sama bopp té meun naa def louma nékhé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1729,"row":{"en":"We scream into a couch cushion, nearby bush, or tree hollow.","wo":"Fi ñuy yuuxoo mooy ci biir njegenaay, ci biir àll bu jege wala ci lëmu garab.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFii gnuy youkhou moy thi biir ndiegenay, thi