ékh yi ak djonganté lekeu tiguedégué ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1736,"row":{"en":"Thank you, the man said You're a kind girl. He took the match and lit it.","wo":"Ku góor ki daal di ni ko Jërëjëf, xale bu jigéen bu baax nga. Mu daal di jël alumet bi taal ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou goor kii daldi niko dieureudieuf, khalé bou djiguéne bou bakh nga. Mou daldi dieul alumet bi taal ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1737,"row":{"en":"She starts dating him, and she quickly falls in love with him.","wo":"Ñu tàmbali di gise, mu tàmbali di nob xale bu góor bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou tambali di guissé mou tambali di nobeu khalé bou goor bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1738,"row":{"en":"He thought of his home town, and the food he would never eat again, and the people he would never see again.","wo":"Xelam dem ci dëkkam, mu xalaat ñam yi mu dul lekkati ci àdduna, teg ci ni nit ñi dootu ñu ko gisati ba fàww.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhélam dem thi deukam, mou khalaat gniam yi mou doul lekati ci aduna, teug ci ni nitt gni dootu gnou ko guissati ba faw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1739,"row":{"en":"If they're rumpled or stained, it will only make you look worse.","wo":"Sudee dañu tilim ba noppi jaxasoo, loolu du wane lu bax ci yaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSudé daniou tilime ba noppi diakhasso, lolou dou wané lou bakh si yaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1740,"row":{"en":"After the fall of the Aksumite Empire, Ethiopia was ruled by a series of different kingdoms and dynasties.","wo":"Ginaaw ba Empire Aksum daanoo, barina ay buur ak famiy yu ngiir yu jiite Ethiopie.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGinaaw ba Empire Aksum danoo barina ay bour ak famiy you nguir you djité Ethiopié.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1741,"row":{"en":"Krishnan was innocent, but Ramasamy refused to listen to him.","wo":"Krishnan deful dara, waaye Ramasamy bëggu ko woon déglu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKrishnan defoul dara wayé Ramasamy beugouko wone deglou dé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1742,"row":{"en":"nice to meet you","wo":"bég naa ci xam la","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBegue naa thi kham la\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1743,"row":{"en":"3. In a bowl, mix together the mustard, treacle, vinegar, Worcestershire sauce and oil.","wo":"3. Nga jël bool bi, jaxase ci mutard, mélasse, bineegar, sauce Worcestershire ak diw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNga dieul bool bi diakhassé ci moutarde, mélasse, binegare, sauce worcestershire ak diw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1744,"row":{"en":"I'm not even sure he eats real food.","wo":"Yaakaaruma ni dina lekk ñam dëgg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYakharouma ni dina leke niam deug rek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1745,"row":{"en":"It is also a good source of carbohydrates, vitamins, and minerals.","wo":"Rox ci dolli noonu la baree glusid, ferñent ak ay mineróo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRokh thi dolli nonou la baré glusid fergnent ak ay minero.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1746,"row":{"en":"Patient: Doctor, I've been having this terrible stomach pain for the past few days.","wo":"Malaad bi: Doktër, Fan yii yépp dama ànd ak biir bu metti bu tar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMalaad bi: Docteur, fane yii yeup dama and ak biir bou metti bou tar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1747,"row":{"en":"Create content that does more than look pretty, but also addresses each customer’s unique journey.","wo":"Sosal ëmbiit budul yam ci taaru rek, waaye na nekk loo xam ni kiliyaan bu nekk mën na ci gis boppam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSosal umbiit boudoul yam si taarou rek wayé na nek lo khamni client bou nek meun na si guiss boppam\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1748,"row":{"en":"We take pride in our work and do our best to do it well.","wo":"Danuy tiitaroo sunu liggéey teg ci defee ko nimu gëna baaxee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDanouy titaroo sounou liguey tegue si défé ko nimou geuna bakhé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1749,"row":{"en":"These reasons should be recorded, reported, and studied for trends.","wo":"Sabab yii dañu leen wara bind, yegge leen ba noppi jàngat leen ngir tendaas yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSabaap yii daniou lén wara bind, yégé lén ba noppi diangat lén nguir tendass yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1750,"row":{"en":"In the upcoming months, I will be honored to receive an award for my work in the field of French language studies.","wo":"Ci weer yii di ñëw, dina am mbégte jot neexal buñu may jox ci sama liggéey bima def ci wàllu njàgum làkku français.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi weer yii di gneuw dina ame mbegte diote neukhal bouniou may diokh thi sama liguey bima def thi wallou ndjagoum lakou francais.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1751,"row":{"en":"After a short time, the princess became thirsty and asked her maid to fetch her a drink of water from a nearby river.","wo":"Nis tuut princesse bi daal di mar, wax mbindaanam mu dem ci dex gi gëna jege mu wutal ko dox mu naan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNiss tout princesse bi daldi mar wakh mbindaname mou dem si deuth gui geuna diegué mou woutal ko dokh mou nane\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1752,"row":{"en":"This can lead to a number of problems, such as reduced traction, decreased braking performance, and leaks.","wo":"Loolu mën na indi jafe-jafe yu bari, lu melni yeexal oto bi, frein yu dul jàpp bu baax, ak senn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLoolou meun na indi diafé diafé you bari, lou melni yeukhal auto bi, frein you doul diap bou bakh, ak senne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1753,"row":{"en":"The white blood cells help to fight infection and to remove damaged tissue.","wo":"Seluli deret yu weex yi ñooy xeex infeksioŋ yi ba noppi dindi tisu bu yàqu bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSelulli deret you wekh yi gnoy khekh infection yi ba noppi dindi tissu bou yakhou bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1754,"row":{"en":"Her paintings are now considered to be masterpieces, and they are still studied and admired by people all over the world.","wo":"Leegi ay tabloom bokk nañu ci tablo yiñ gëna weg, ba leegi nit ñaa ngi koy bëgg, diko jàng fépp ci àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLegui ay tablo bokk nagnou si tablo yign geuna weg ba legui nitt gna ngui koy beug diko diang fepp si addouna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1755,"row":{"en":"We’re breaking down the biggest moments episode-by-episode!","wo":"Noo ngi amal njàngat ci mbir yu am solo yi, episod par episod!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNongi amal ndiangat thi mbir you am solo yi episode par episode !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1756,"row":{"en":"With tongs, he or she can flip a steak or turn a roast.","wo":"Ak keppukaay yi mën na wëlbati steak wala yàpp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAk keppoukay yi meun na weulbeuti steak wala yapp.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1757,"row":{"en":"The hike was gorgeous (and steep!), but invigorating to take in the majestic scenery—the float was a blast too.","wo":"Doxantu bi neexonna (te gaaw!), waye dan na joxe cawarte ci di xool joor gu rafet gi - flotër bi tamit nekkonna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDokhatou bi nekhoneu (te gaw!), wayé dane na diokhé thiawarté thi di khol dior gou rafet gui - flotër bi tamit neukoneu.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1758,"row":{"en":"Bynes's performance is a standout, and the film is full of laugh-out-loud moments.","wo":"Li Bynes jouer ci film boobu yéeme na, ba noppi flim bi bari pàrti yooy xàkkataay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi Bynes jouer ci film bobou yémé na, ba noppi flim bi bari parti yoyou khàkkataay.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1759,"row":{"en":"He came at me all excitable, pushing his chubby little thumb into my forehead and being all cute.","wo":"Dafa niow sama wet ànd mbégte, daal tek baraam mam ci sama jë ti wane taaram.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa niew sama wet ande mbegte dal tekk baraam mame ci sama dieuti wané taaram\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1760,"row":{"en":"The other birds cheered and thanked the robin for saving the day.","wo":"Yeneen picc yi tàccu ko, gërëm ko ndax liggéey bu mag bimu def.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYénéne pic thi tatchou ko gueureum ko ndakh liguey bou mag bi mou def.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1761,"row":{"en":"There will be times when we make mistakes or when we are faced with difficult choices.","wo":"Dina am jamono nu def njuumte, wala nu wara def tànneef yu jafe.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDina ame diamono niou def ndioumté wala niou wara def tanéf you diafé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1762,"row":{"en":"* 1 cup almond flour","wo":"* 1 kaasu farinu amànd","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\n1 kassou farinou amande\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1763,"row":{"en":"We also become more mindful of the people who will benefit from our work, and we are more likely to go the extra mile to make sure that it is done well.","wo":"Te itam danuy gëna bàyyi xel ci nit ñi sunu liggéey di amal njariñ, te dina tax nu liggéey lu ëpp linu waroon liggéey, lépp ndax dangay bëgg mbir yi jaar yoon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTé itam daniouy geuna bayi khel thi nitt gni souniou liguey di amal ndiarigne té dina takh niou liguey lou eup linou warone liguey leup ndakh dangay beug mbir yi diar yone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1764,"row":{"en":"Joseph: Anything for you, Jasmine.","wo":"Joseph: Loo bëgg rek, Jasmine.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJoseph: loo beug rek Jasmine\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1765,"row":{"en":"The tree was now standing upright and stable.","wo":"Leegi garab gi jubbantiku na, jub xocc.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLegui garab gui dioubbantikou na dioub khoth.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1766,"row":{"en":"In recent years, some traditional customs in Ghana have been adapted to modern life.","wo":"At yii weesu, amna cosaan ak aada yu Ghana yuñ jël boole ci jumtukaay yu xew ci jamono.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAtt yii wessou, amna cosane ak aada you ghana yougn dieul boolé ci jumtoukay you hew thi diamono.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1767,"row":{"en":"With a little practice, you'll be able to relax on command, whenever you need to.","wo":"Soo koy faral di def, leegi nga mën di féexal sa yaram saa yu la neexee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo koy faral di def légui nga meun di fékhale sa yarame sa youla nékhé\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1768,"row":{"en":"We talked about our dreams, our hopes, and our fears.","wo":"Nu waxtaane sunuy mébet, sunuy yaakaar ak linu ragal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNgnou wakhtané souniouy mébéte souniouy yakar ak liniou ragal\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1769,"row":{"en":"In the 7th century AD, Sudan was conquered by the Arabs, who brought Islam to the region.","wo":"Ci 7eelu xarnu ginaaw JC, ci la Araab yi dugg Sudan daal di dugal Islam ci gox bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi 7éme xarnou guinaw JC, thi la arab yi dougg soudan daldi dougal islam thi gox bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1770,"row":{"en":"Person B: I love it! I can't wait to start creating fragrances that will make Australia proud.","wo":"Nit B: Loolu neex nama! Yàkka,ti naa tàmbali defar xetu parfum buy siggil Australie.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNit B: Loolou nekh nama! Yakati naa tambali defar khettou parfum bouy siggil australie.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1771,"row":{"en":"It is fairer to listen to the string that broke than to never strain a bow.","wo":"Dégg buum guy dagg moo gën ñàkka tàwwi buum.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeg boum guy dague mo gueun niaka tawi boum.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1772,"row":{"en":"However, one experience that I will never forget is the time I got prison beer delivered to my dorm room.","wo":"Waaye benn ci jaar-jaar yi ma am ak bieer yu ma dul fàtte ba mukk mooy bi ñu ma indilee keesu bieer sama néeg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé bene ci jaar jaar yi ma ame ak biere you ma doul faté ba mouk moy bi gnou ma indilé késsou biere sama négué.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1773,"row":{"en":"In the case of the recent dog attack in which a grandmother was killed, it appears that the dog was not properly trained and that it was feeling threatened by the grandmother's presence.","wo":"Bu yàggul dara amoon na xaj bu fi songoon maamu jàmbur bamu faatu, liko waraloon mooy kenn tàggatul woon xaj bi nimu waree, tax su gisee maam ji dafay ragal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBou yaggoul dara amone na khadj bou fi songone mamou diambour bammou faatou, liko waralone moy kene taggatoul wone khadj bi nimou waré, takh sou guissé maam dji dafay ragal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1774,"row":{"en":"It’s a large, dark shape, and it’s moving towards the house.","wo":"Jëmm ju rëy la, ñuul ba noppi di jubal si ci kër gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDieum diou reuy la nioul ba noppi di dioubal si si keur gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1775,"row":{"en":"No doubt they are as anxious and excited about all this as we are.","wo":"Leer nama ni ñoom ak nun noo bokk yàkkamti gis ak bégg ci mbir mi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLér nama ni gnom ak noun no bok yakamti guiss ak beug thi mbir mi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1776,"row":{"en":"Egypt ruled Sudan until 1885, when it was conquered by the Mahdi, a religious leader who led a rebellion against Egyptian rule.","wo":"Egypt jiite na Sudan ba atum 1885, laata benn njiitu diine du tuddu Mahdi, jiite woon ay way-fippu di xeex ak waa Egypt ba jële leen fa.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nEgypte djité na Soudan ba atoum 1885, lata bene njiitou diné dou toudou Mahdi, djité wone ay way-fippou di khekh ak wa egypte ba dieulé léne fa.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1777,"row":{"en":"The ceremony is typically very elaborate and involves music, dancing, and food.","wo":"Ni ñuy amalee dëj dafa rafet te dafay amaale music, fecc ak lekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNi gnouy amalé deuj dafa rafet té dafay amalé music, feuth ak lekk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1778,"row":{"en":"From the ancient Egyptian mummies to the modern-day paintings, there was something for everyone to enjoy.","wo":"Li ko dalee ci momi yu maami Egypt ba ci tablo art yu sunuy jamono, ku nekk dina fi fekk luko mëna neex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLiko dalé thi momi you mami egypt ba thi tablo art you souniouy diamono, kou nek dina fi fek louko meuna nékhé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1779,"row":{"en":"Each step unleashed a waft of that divine scent, filling my lungs with pure bliss.","wo":"Jéego bu nekk dafa doon fësal tuuti leeru boroom bi fees ci dënn yi and barke.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjégo bou nek dafa done feussal touti leerou borom bi fess thi deunn yi ak barké.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1780,"row":{"en":"Here, too, males’ education outcomes improved significantly.","wo":"Fii itam njariñu njàngum góor ñi dafa yokk bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFii itam njarignou njangoum goor gni dafa yokh bou bakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1781,"row":{"en":"The smell of fresh-baked bread wafted through the air as the baker pulled a tray of golden brown loaves from the oven.","wo":"Xetu mburu mu ñuy sooga lakk moo doon obale bi lakk-katu mburu mi di génne miisi mburu yu xonk yi ci fuur bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhetou mbourou mou gnuy soga lakk mo don obalé bi lakk-katou mbourou mi di guéné miissi mbourou you khonk yi thi four bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1782,"row":{"en":"We can all help to make a difference by speaking out against it and by supporting organizations that work to stop it.","wo":"Ku nekk ci nun mën na ko xeex su yëkkatee kàddom ñaawlu ko ba noppi di jàppale mbootaay yiy xeex loolu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou nek si gnoune meun nako khekh sou yeukaté kadom gnawlouko ba noppi di diapalé mbotaay yiy khekh lolou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1783,"row":{"en":"Whatever the reason, there is no denying the bond that exists between humans and horses.","wo":"Ak lu mëna nekk sabab bi, amna diggante bu am solo diggante nit ñi ak fay yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAk lou meuna nekk sabab bi amna diguenté bou am solo diguenté nitt gni ak fay yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1784,"row":{"en":"I know it might be hard to let go of that rag, but it’s important.","wo":"Xamnaa ni du yomb nga lakk ko waaye lu war la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhamna ni dou yombe nga lak ko wayé lou war la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1785,"row":{"en":"The creature is right behind us.","wo":"Rab waa ngi sunu ginaaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRap wa ngui souniou guinaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1786,"row":{"en":"Kidney diseases are a serious problem that can affect people of all ages.","wo":"Feeb