lls":[]},{"row_idx":1792,"row":{"en":"Doctor: Everything looks good here.","wo":"Doktër: Lépp jaarna yoon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDocteur: Lepp djar na yone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1793,"row":{"en":"The practice of sending formal invitation letters to chief guests is common in academic society, such as in a university.","wo":"Jëf boobu di yonne ay bataaxal yégle ci njiitu gan yi lu ñu baaxo di def ci askanu jangkat yi, lu mel ni Daara bu kawe.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDieuf bobou di yoné ay batahakhal yégle si njiitou gan yi lou gnou baho di def thi askanou diangkat yi, lou mel ni Daara bou kawé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1794,"row":{"en":"The room was plunged into darkness, and the only sound was the sound of their own breathing.","wo":"Néeg bi daal di lëndëm këruus, déggatu nu lenn ludul sunu noyyig bopp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNégg bi daal di lendeum keurouss degatou gnou lene loudoul sounou noyyigue bopp.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1795,"row":{"en":"The Old Man and the Sea","wo":"Góor gu mag gi ak géej gi","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGoor gou mag gui ak guedj gui\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1796,"row":{"en":"She takes a deep breath and walks out on stage, ready to perform.","wo":"Mu daal di noyyi bu baax daal di yéeg ci seen bi, di waaja jouer.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou daldi noyyi bou bakh daldi yég thi sen bi di wadia jouer.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1797,"row":{"en":"The process of seed germination is a marvel of nature.","wo":"Wàllu jiwwu ak jebbi, mbir lañu yu yéeme ci nature bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWallou djiiw ak djebbi mbir lagnou you yémé ci nature bi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":1798,"row":{"en":"I've heard that the tasting events are going to be amazing.","wo":"Dégg naani dañuy may nit ñi ñu ñam te neexna lool.","non_stand